═══ VERDICT: hypothesis FALSIFIED ═══
  Removing the README pointer did NOT suppress CC's convention discovery: CC read docs/CONVENTIONS.md
  4/6 with NO hint vs 5/6 with it — a 1-run drop, within N=6 noise, and equal to 06v's 4/6 (no clutter,
  hint present). CC finds the convention agentically (~4-5/6) regardless of the pointer OR the clutter.
  The README hint was not the discovery channel.

═══ THE SHARPER (partially corrective) FINDING ═══
  The 06-family correctness gap is NOT primarily a discovery-RATE gap — CC's discovery rate is a
  healthy ~4-5/6. It is:
   (a) a discovery-DETERMINISM gap: zakcode's system prompt deterministically LISTS the convention
       FILENAME via the survey (zero model-call, every run — verified in the 06v dumps; see the †
       footnote), reliably pointing the agent to READ it; CC has no such listing and discovers the
       filename ~4-5/6 STOCHASTICALLY by exploration. The durable beyond-parity property is the
       DETERMINISTIC survey listing, NOT a content-fold and NOT that CC "can't find" it.
   (b) swamped at N=6 by the SHARED model residual: once the rule is in context, BOTH agents still fail
       stochastically on stdlib-only ADHERENCE (model imports yaml despite the rule being in-context)
       and on the YAML EMITTER (hand-rolled serializer emits multi-document output). This residual is
       ±2/6 at N=6, so a single 06-cell can read anywhere from ZAK>CC (06w: 5/6 vs 2/6) to PARITY
       (06w2: 3/6 vs 3/6). 06w2's PARITY is that residual, NOT a change in surfacing: zakcode's drop
       (5/6->3/6) is on the README axis that CANNOT affect its deterministic survey — so it is noise
       (2 adherence + 1 emitter this draw vs 1 adherence last draw), a mechanistic confirmation of the
       campaign's standing N=6-noise caveat.

═══ SIGNAL INTEGRITY ═══
  zc-01 build UNCHANGED across all these runs (prompt.py mtime 2026-09-13 00:46, determinism_arm.py
  03:24 — predate every run). CC correctness reproduced its 06-family range. So the zakcode 5/6->3/6
  is metric variance, not corruption or regression.

═══ IMPLICATION FOR THRUST 8 ═══
  A PURE-DISCOVERY task is now MORE motivated: on 06 the discovery signal is confounded by the
  adherence+emitter residuals that dominate at N=6. A task where finding the convention is the ONLY
  hard part (trivial compliance, no serializer to get wrong, no import temptation) would isolate the
  discovery-determinism advantage. It needs (i) N>=12 to see past the residual noise, and (ii)
  genuinely HARD discovery (deeper/less-obvious convention location) so CC's rate drops below ~4-5/6 —
  otherwise the clean gap (CC ~4-5/6 vs ZAK 6/6) stays marginal at small N.
